# {{lb|en|geography}} A [[landlocked]] sea between [[Eastern Europe]] and [[Asia]], and the Earth’s largest [[inland]] body of water.

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|Mazandaran Sea}}
* {{l|en|Hyrcanian Sea}}
* {{l|en|Khazar Sea}}

